                                                              "take":  "Santoli is effectively telling investors the free-lunch phase of the AI trade is over: you can no longer get equity upside without credible downside protection, and bonds are now priced to provide it. The real signal to watch is not the bond yield level but the direction of corporate credit spreadsÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âwidening spreads from historically tight levels historically precede equity volatility by six to twelve weeks. Santoli\u0027s observation that Nvidia is trading at a discount to the broad market P/E is a structural shift worth taking seriously; it signals that the market has stopped giving AI hardware a blank-check multiple and is demanding visible earnings paths.",
